  moTa: "G\xE0 tr\u1ED1ng oai v\u1EC7 c\xF9ng g\xE0 m\xE1i v\xE0 \u0111\xE0n g\xE0
    con qu\xE2y qu\u1EA7n b\xEAn nhau t\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0ng cho gia \u0111\xECnh
    sum v\u1EA7y, con ch\xE1u \u0111\u1EC1 hu\u1EC1, cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng no \u0111\u1EE7.
    Tranh c\xF2n g\u1EEDi g\u1EAFm l\u1EDDi ch\xFAc h\xF2a thu\u1EADn, sinh s\xF4i
    v\xE0 m\u1ED9t n\u0103m l\xE0m \u0103n thu\u1EADn l\u1EE3i."
